Hello everyone,

Today the LXC project is pleased to announce the release of:
 - LXC 1.0.11
 - LXC 2.0.9
 - LXC 2.1.1
 - LXD 2.0.11
 - LXCFS 2.0.8

They each contain the accumulated bugfixes since the previous round of
bugfix releases about five months ago.


The detailed changelogs for each of those can be found at:
 - https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/lxc-1-0-11-has-been-released/677
 - https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/lxc-2-0-9-has-been-released/680
 - https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/lxc-2-1-1-has-been-released/676
 - https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/lxd-2-0-11-has-been-released/682
 - https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/lxcfs-2-0-8-has-been-released/675

As a reminder, the 2.0 series of all of those is supported for bugfix
and security updates up until June 2021.

The LXC 1.0.x branch is supported until June 2019 with critical bugfixes
and security updates only, users are recommended to upgrade to 2.0.x.

Thanks to everyone who contributed to those projects and helped make
this possible!


St=E9phane Graber
On behalf of the LXC, LXCFS and LXD development teams

